description: pyahocorasick is a fast and memory efficient library for exact or approximate multi-pattern
  string search.  With the ahocorasick.Automaton class, you can find multiple key strings occurrences
  at once in some input text.  You can use it as a plain dict-like Trie or convert a Trie to
  an automaton for efficient Aho-Corasick search.  Implemented in C and tested on Python 2.7
  and 3.4+.  Works on Linux, Mac and Windows. BSD-3-clause license.
